>>>

<<<
socker, -ccer. The -k- is recommended; accept, success, eccentrictty, accident, flaccid, coccyx, show the almost invariable sound of -ccbefore e, i, y; perhaps the sole exception is baccy, which the -ccin tobacco makes more excusable than soccer.
===
**socker, -ccer.** The -k- is recommended; *accept, success, eccentricity, accident, flaccid, coccyx,* show the almost invariable sound of -cc- before e, i, y; perhaps the sole exception is *baccy,* which the -cc- in *tobacco* makes more excusable than *soccer.*
>>>

